  "explanation": "Construct directed graph with lexically sorted destinations. Hierholzer's Algorithm (DFS) finds Eulerian path; post-order backtrack build creates correct topological flight order.",
  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION findItinerary(tickets):\n    adj = SORTED_HASH_MAP_OF_LISTS(), res = []\n    FOR t IN tickets DO APPEND t[1] TO adj[t[0]]\n    FUNCTION dfs(src):\n        WHILE adj[src] IS NOT EMPTY DO:\n            dst = POP_FIRST(adj[src])\n            dfs(dst)\n        END WHILE\n        PREPEND src TO res\n    END FUNCTION\n    dfs('JFK')\n    RETURN res\nEND FUNCTION",
